[{"id":166471311,"discussion_id":"5728ff09658b50d70423f1c599ace5c571e699ce","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| pkg_inc | ✅ [*jia0liang*](https://gitcode.com/jia0liang), [*wangrui_*](https://gitcode.com/wangrui_), [*王永光*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang) (3/2) | ✅ [*王永光*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang) (1/1) |\n| repo-cann/opbase | ✅ [*wangrui_*](https://gitcode.com/wangrui_), [*jia0liang*](https://gitcode.com/jia0liang) (2/2) | ✅ [*wangrui_*](https://gitcode.com/wangrui_), [*jia0liang*](https://gitcode.com/jia0liang) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n sunzhongwen1, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-26T14:55:26+08:00","updated_at":"2026-05-20T09:31:53+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166471333,"discussion_id":"09fc5352fda4a23145dc9c8cea14908005539c3e","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-26T14:55:33+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-26T14:55:33+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166471686,"discussion_id":"2ab281c55b25383ba7cf73ec23a5d8f820bfcb06","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要针对Reduce算子实现进行了一系列代码重构、健壮性增强和性能优化。核心内容包括：1）移除冗余的辅助函数，简化代码结构；2）修复在特定计算模式（RA模式、TailA模式）及混合精度场景下，内存对齐计算因硬编码数据类型大小或使用不一致常量而导致的潜在错误；3）优化非连续内存布局下的对齐计算逻辑；4）改进分块计算中UB块和Cache Line大小的计算方式，统一使用最小输入字节数以确保内存访问对齐，提升计算稳定性和性能。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案主要包括：1）删除`ReduceSch`模板类中功能完全重复的`CopyOutAuxGroup`函数，统一使用`CopyOutAux`。2）在`CalculateViewRAMode`等函数中，将对齐计算基准从硬编码的`sizeof(T)`替换为从基类继承或操作图中获取的`MIN_DTYPE_BYTES`或`minInputBytes`常量，确保计算一致性。3）在`PostReduce`函数中为混合精度搬出操作正确设置源步长，并在`CopyOut`函数中动态推导输出数据类型，增强通用性。4）在`ComputeCacheLineBlock`等分块计算函数中，统一使用`minInputBytes`计算UB块和Cache Line元素个数，优化内存对齐。所有修改均不改变外部接口，属于内部逻辑优化与问题修复。","created_at":"2026-03-26T14:57:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-26T14:57:16+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166996361,"discussion_id":"1a65b82506de9006226f09848af429529df8fcc2","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-31T17:10:56+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-31T17:10:56+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe